{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1647846,\"title\":\"Emergency Special! This Is Kamen Rider Eins!\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A special that acts as a prelude to Kamen Rider Eins with Girls Remix.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/57P74V5HOcIzOMrnDmc6rfhxHzl.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gNu8fBS45bZuDciBnNj9PkyqEkA.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2026,\"runtime\":9,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\",\"Action\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2959275,\"name\":\"Amane Tensho\",\"character\":\"Nayuta Mikazuki / Kamen Rider Eins\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1FMFfkjGiK03etSNXIEY4W2XePw.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":634429,\"title\":\"Shin Ultraman\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8e4WjXrOY7WH94jlhBeoYCYUVwj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bW2R6PejAFk6FVCyLmTsgn8ETqZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Japanese government sets up a special task force to fight the giant creatures suddenly appearing across the country. Soon, the squad unexpectedly meets a giant silver humanoid who starts appearing every time a space monster attacks!\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":813477,\"title\":\"Shin Kamen Rider\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9dTO2RygcDT0cQkawABw4QkDegN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ccFavvHGfhA5yI32K0bzDjlyKSN.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A man forced to bear power and stripped of humanity. A woman skeptical of happiness. Takeshi Hongo, an Augmentation made by SHOCKER, and Ruriko Midorikawa, a rebel of the organization, escape while fighting off assassins. What’s justice? What’s evil? Will this violence end? Despite his power, Hongo tries to remain human. Along with freedom, Ruriko has regained a heart. What paths will they choose?\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1234950,\"title\":\"Ohsama Sentai King-Ohger vs. Donbrothers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z5p3iqwC22WLhutahGWXiEx492W.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8xQoXhxN8ZnqIwoCEiKEVbhz0Uh.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The King-Ohgers and the Donbrothers are now in Hakabaka, the Land of the Dead. They all died due to various reasons. The confrontation begins with neither party knowing who the other is. Will there be an end to this battle? I mean, why did they start fighting in the first place?! Eventually, they arrive at a single abyssal truth!\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":274049,\"title\":\"Space Sheriff Sharivan: NEXT GENERATION\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bS1YUCqiATFyTfvtBYNLwgk8AHa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uI81GyyX7eer1fCrJ7D1AXWOECY.jpg\",\"rating\":8.7,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Kai Hyuga / Sharivan uncovers the existence of a spy from the Neo Madou organization. In addition to that Kai's friend, Seigi, becomes the new Space Sheriff Estevan. They must find the spy and stop a drug ring from shipping a pain suppressing narcotic called Hyper-M on Earth. But the new Space Sheriff must learn to trust his instincts and that not all is as it seems...\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":848629,\"title\":\"Mashin Sentai Kiramager Spin-Off: Yodonna\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rZUt5ayh7pComsdnhtsKuFZoa1o.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mHHfQ0b8hJO84nG3KKTWfCNvbe.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Kiramager special focusing on the characters of Yodonna and Mizuki Kakihara\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":270691,\"title\":\"Armor Hero Emperor\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/efqGRk05JxUrAD7S7Qmsm30xmhr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kdV8zv6hJw50SWfH8RESZa0Syo4.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the Armor Heroes united to seal up the Dark Forces Monsters, the city regained its peace and happiness. Since Monster Ten was not successfully sealed up, Mei Zhen found Zi Yang, hoping that when danger and difficulty arises, Zi Yang would be able to seal up this last monster and would completely eradicate the forces of darkness on earth. Meanwhile the Five sealed in the Monster Sealing Box, in order to fulfill their quest for world domination, used the forces of darkness to entice an angry youth, and created new mutants to create havoc in the city.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":272157,\"title\":\"Ressha Sentai ToQger The Movie: Galaxy Line S.O.S.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cJKYymElIYuErghF8KxAQ65Moy9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sxyqjODlkZgBpAthGUGGcNWqAU6.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The film follows the Safari Ressha who run the Galaxy Line, their conductor named Lady, and the Shadow Line member pursuing them.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":267046,\"title\":\"Kikaider Reboot\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wGirjKumQOvnd49hZXbo7vV3FVW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3jvZMqTLS7lglXA1Ght7WS3ay4d.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the near future, the brilliant Dr. Komyoji is enlisted to lead the ARK Project—a scientific endeavor dedicated to forging a brighter tomorrow through robotics. However, the doctor’s mysterious death puts those plans to an abrupt hold... Not long after, the grieving Komyoji children wander into the crosshairs of a black ops squad on the hunt for their father’s research. But from within the cross fire emerges Jiro—a bleeding-edge android programmed to protect the siblings! Now on the run, the Komyojis soon discover their father’s once hopeful ambitions have taken a DARK turn...\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1044957,\"title\":\"Kamen Rider Saber: Kamen Rider Sabela & Durendal\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eDJLfQ3s21bxrQkExOKTIVMqumf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rxUyyPXDWqpF1E2atr7DOivpSop.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"One year after the battle days of Sword of Logos ended, Reika Shindai is preparing for her wedding. However, this happiness is unexpectedly abrupted when her brother Ryoga receives some disturbing details about the upcoming wedding.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":270313,\"title\":\"Heisei Rider vs. Showa Rider: Kamen Rider Wars feat. Super Sentai\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Aizl6PWROQ3bGUnOpXiamkkyZfs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/agg9Idb7rpJJG6OmdYs3ju9PFrd.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Underground Empire Badan makes its move, intending to invert the world. Kouta and Mai are pulled through one of these inversions where the discover a boy named Shu, who also holds the power to invert the world. As the Riders fight to protect Shu, Fifteen appears again, seeking Shu. As Kouta flees, past Riders gather and fight one another, split between the Showa and Heisei era Riders. But, the truth of Badan is not as it seems…\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1054265,\"title\":\"Hoshi 35\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tHf6VWl8JUfpiVriSqqCZpwbpCA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gOitsnBvJ6B8zNKk5SaPmeJ7pLr.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Aki lived her young life with a baby monster, but got separated from it for some reason. Thirty-five years later, a big earthquake hits her home. As the shaking grows stronger, a giant monster emerges… no longer a baby kaiju, the creature has grown…\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1442249,\"title\":\"Damager\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uDMh88LDSG2cRXEZopOKwOcK5lK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mxdoRv0mCr2LKfhwLU5aDZZlpLZ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Tokusatsu short movie by Noboru Iguchi about a masochist superhero. Released as a double bill with Hentaidan.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"h-klZGpNL40\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"g_VpN8lhdrg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Xejlx7XLHsQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}